== part 9: Proposition 2.5 and Remark 2.6 (mismatch rates) on random pairs of distributions
  100000 random pairs (A, P) on 2 to 7 answers: min of (mismatch probability - TV) = -1.110e-16
  max |sum (A-P)^2 - (2 rho_AP - rho_AA - rho_PP)| = 6.661e-16
